              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="param">
              <div class="param-header">
                <label for="efd-sub-eps">Substrate &epsilon;</label>
                <input type="number" class="param-number" id="efd-sub-eps" value="0" step="0.5" min="0" title="0 = no stack; the two permittivities above are then used as they are">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="efd-stack" id="efd-stack" hidden>
              <span class="efd-src-note">
                The substrate is the half-space at the bottom. Layers added here
