              <button id="efd-dl-csv" class="export-btn" type="button" title="Download the current result as CSV">CSV</button>
              <button id="efd-dl-json" class="export-btn" type="button" title="Download the full solver payload, notes included">JSON</button>
              {/* initPermalinks wires every [data-copy-link] on the page, so
                  this needs no id and no handler of its own. It shares the
                  settings, not the numbers: the URL carries the headline
