            {/* One row per ribbon, straight from the geometry payload, so it
                follows every keystroke rather than the last run. Seven boxes
                could only ever show the structure's aggregates -- a single
                node count, a single dx -- which say nothing at all once the
                ribbons differ from each other, and differing is the point of
                having five. */}
            <div class="efd-table-wrap">
              {/* OUTSIDE the table. renderRibbonTable sets the table's own
                  innerHTML, which would take a <caption> child with it -- and
